"The Heavenly Demon Chixia, posing as a courtesan, seduced and controlled Zang Zeng for months."
"Chixia poisoned Zang Zeng into paranoia and steered him with a soothing, soul-bending voice."
"Zang Zeng broke free enough to strike Chixia with Heaven's Judgement before a Puppet Worm took him."
"Chixia's cult sought the Sect's Fulmination Arrays to build teleporting shadows."
